<p>Hi <%= @shipment.client_primary_contact_name.presence || @shipment.client_name %>,</p>

<p>
  Attached is your invoice from <%= @shipment.bakery.name %> for the delivery on
  <%= @shipment.date.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>.
</p>

<p>
  Invoice #<%= @shipment.invoice_number %><br>
  Amount due: <%= number_to_currency(@shipment.price) %><br>
  Payment due: <%= @shipment.payment_due_date.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>
</p>

<p>Please let us know if you have any questions.</p>
